  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is the solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, and the slope of the curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is never zero, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mi>y</mi><mfenced><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfenced></math> is _____ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given differential equation is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>y</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Integrating both sides, we get,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mi>y</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Given, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;or, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Considering <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mi>y</mi><mfenced><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
